spans.s:
Vi-vayana denotes in the Brāhmaṇas ‘plaited work,’ such as
that used in a couch (Asandī).
^1 Aitareya Brāhmaṇa, viii. 5, 3;
Śatapatha Brāhmaṇā, xii. 8, 3, 6. In
the Sūtras vivāna has the same sense;
Lāṭyāyana Srauta Sūtra, iii, 12, 1, etc.

) Taittirīya Saṃhitā, vii. 2, 8, 7;
Kāṭhaka Saṃhitā, xxv. 3; Pañcaviṃśa
Brāhmaṇa, vii. 10, 4; Aitareya Brāh-
maṇa, iv, 27, 5, and often in the Sūtras.
